<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM load factor rises in October.</title>
<headline>KLM load factor rises in October.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional traffic and load factor figures from KLM Royal Dutch Airlines (millions of tonne-kilometres unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>			   Oct 1996   Oct 95   Apr-Oct 96   Apr-Oct 95</p>
<p>TOTAL TRAFFIC</p>
<p> Traffic		  773.7     717.6     5,110.0    4,788.2</p>
<p> Capacity	     1,018.1     961.7     7,004.5    6,513.3</p>
<p> Load factor (pct)	76.0     74.6	  73.0	 73.5</p>
<p>PASSENGER TRAFFIC</p>
<p> Passenger kilometres 4,339.2   3,986.3    29,887.5   27,526.5</p>
<p> Seat kilometres	5,631.7   5,275.4    38,908.2   35,969.5</p>
<p> Load factor (pct)	 77.0	75.6	  76.8	 76.5</p>
<p>FREIGHT TRAFFIC</p>
<p> Traffic		    362.3     338.4     2,296.7    2,196.9</p>
<p> Capacity		   506.7     485.9     3,483.7    3,268.6</p>
<p> Load factor (pct)	 71.5	69.6	  65.9	 67.2</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
